chapter.v:
	Now the 

	 Lord spoke to Moses after the death of the two sons of Aaron, when they offered profane fire before the Lord, and died;
 [Lev. 10:1, 2;]

	And the 

	 priest, who is anointed and consecrated to minister as priest in his father’s place, shall make atonement, and put on the linen clothes, the holy garments;
 [Lev. 4:3, 5, 16; 21:10 k Ex. 29:29, 30; Num. 20:26, 28 (Matt. 25:31–34).]
